# --- Overnight UWB capture RAW data: keep LOCAL ONLY, never commit (GitHub LFS quota) ---
# Covers both the normal tree and the doubled-nested .../broadcast/SS-TWR/.../broadcast/logs/ path.
# Small results (summary.json, *.png, analysis artifacts) are STILL committed to normal Git.
# To force-keep a specific processed csv, add a negation below, e.g.:
#   !**/broadcast/logs/**/keep_me.csv
**/broadcast/logs/**/*.csv
**/broadcast/logs/**/*.log
